{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"What's your wish? Admittedly, mine was a little selfish.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:18:54.333000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878916127772794911","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I was thinking that I wish to be someone people in Arcania can rely on. I came here for my swarm, and that's pretty much our philosophy. But at the same time, I suppose it's something I'll need to get to by my own work.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:19:45.319000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878916341623566347","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"she squeezes his hand, before speaking, 'I'd wish that the city would become a safe haven for anyone who wishes to live here, regardless of who they are.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:21:06.892000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878916683765534740","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
