{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Roy nods. \"That sounds great too.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:21:36.636000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878916808520912897","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"(Time to go a huntin)","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:21:58.478000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878916900132892682","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'There's... probably more people out there who are like I used to be, walking corpses. I know that fear. And from that, I can understand others' fear of being different, being pushed out and possibly killed for who they are.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:22:08.296000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878916941312565248","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:22:30.151000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878917032979075112","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'Us reborn as walking corpses might be against nature, but... it's not like we asked for it. At least, I definitely didn't - my old self might have, but she's in the past now.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:23:16.649000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878917228005847071","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'So I'd especially like to help anyone else in... my old situation.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:23:40.031000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878917326077067325","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"So what do we wish for?\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:23:57.932000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878917401159299083","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I was thinking maybe to wish for healing, and comfort. The war hasn't ended yet so it feels silly to wish for that though.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:25:45.150000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878917850864164875","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'It's never too early to start healing.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:26:09.587000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878917953360388176","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"The undead are not inherently against nature.\" Says web between marshmallows. \"They are a part of the cycle just as much.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:26:53.138000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878918136026517568","reply_to_id":"878917228005847071","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'...tell that to the people who wanted me dead. Well. Re-dead.' she shrugs. 'Even if not, then, they're seen as such.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:27:31.048000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878918295032594442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"A wound that heals too fast leaves an ugly scar. And picking at scabs only ends in blood. It's, it's a strange wish.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:28:06.214000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878918442529468457","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Sabrine absentmindedly rubs the scar on her forehead.","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:28:39.036000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878918580194914334","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Would something like better future be too vague? It does seem to matter for the stones, no idea if shooting stars are picky too.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:30:25.045000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878919024828899358","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I think we're overthinking this.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:30:43.413000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878919101869875250","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I'm sure we are.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:31:03.679000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878919186871636039","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"She looks back up at the stars. \"I wish for hope. People can do a lot with hope.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T08:33:05.623000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878919698341847081","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
