{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"She looks aside to Sabrine and Roy. \"Did... she just invite the Wardens to their ceremony?\"\n\n`From my understanding, yes.`","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:01:28.287000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878926839832252426","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
