{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"Roy shrugs. (it is absolutely not a surprise at all)","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:03:26.714000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878927336551116850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I can't tell you if it was good or bad, but it was certainly something.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:05:52.561000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878927948277751808","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"she shrugs, looking confused. 'We're likely to be working together in the future. No reason not to start friendships now, right?'","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:06:30.264000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878928106415587368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Making friends is always good. Just surprised is all.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:09:22.569000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878928829115158559","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'Besides, if Gil's joining them, then by definition we're major allies.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:11:36.581000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878929391202205766","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Not even in that context, a friend of a friend is a friend too.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:13:54.359000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878929969085050910","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"I mean, you're looking at it closely. In the bigger picture, they're the Wardens of Arcania. We are *in* Arcania.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:15:34.793000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878930390335758347","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'Oh, so we didn't need to invite them because by definition they're invited everywhere by default?'","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:17:39.979000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878930915403894785","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"In a way. And for now. Though I am still kind of bummed we might have froze them out in the Constitution last week. All I wanted really was that we'd be free to make our own choices, I think it's obvious how important that is to me. But... well. Whatever.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:18:29.020000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-22T09:24:31.693000Z","id":"878931121096757258","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'I hope everything works out alright with that...'","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:22:59.790000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878932256788459550","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Nonetheless, no reason not to openly invite them. Worst case they just won't come. Especially if they let us make this new home here. Just like when I wanted the congress to formally acknowledge we're grateful for this chance and will do what we can to not waste it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:25:44.528000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878932947749732362","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'Agreed. We understand they might not be willing or able to for whatever reason, but it's only polite to give a proper invitation.'","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:26:50.860000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878933225966293023","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"What I was trying to saw really was that, you don't need Gil between you to find a connection with the Wardens. I think my point got lost in my own head there.\" She laughs softly.","created_at":"2021-08-22T09:28:09.960000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878933557735751710","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
